Approach :
- For each test case, check whether a is already divisible by b using a % b.
- If not, print b - (a % b) to show the minimum number needed to make a divisible by b; otherwise print 0.

CODE :

def divisibility(n):
    for _ in range(n):
        a,b = map(int, input().split())
        if a%b==0:
            print(0)
        else:
            print(b-(a%b))


n=int(input())
divisibility(n)
